From 3e0a55222ee0e0f3edf1ff6a0f411b5ce74e91df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 03:06:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sorted-keys): add ignoredKeys parameter

Add an `ignoredKeys` parameter to the sorted-keys template. The values of
the listed keys are not checked for sorting at any nesting level, e.g.
`ignoredKeys: ["labels", "annotations"]` skips label and annotation maps
that Helm charts often render from user input via `include`. The position
of the ignored key among its siblings is still checked.

Fixes #1194
---
 docs/generated/templates.md                   |  9 ++++
 .../sortedkeys/internal/params/gen-params.go  | 17 +++++++
 .../sortedkeys/internal/params/params.go      |  6 +++
 pkg/templates/sortedkeys/template.go          | 27 +++++++---
 pkg/templates/sortedkeys/template_test.go     | 51 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../testdata/unsorted-labels-annotations.yaml | 23 +++++++++
 6 files changed, 125 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 pkg/templates/sortedkeys/testdata/unsorted-labels-annotations.yaml

diff --git a/docs/generated/templates.md b/docs/generated/templates.md
index 8d378db..ec12fc6 100644
--- a/docs/generated/templates.md
+++ b/docs/generated/templates.md
@@ -925,6 +925,15 @@ KubeLinter supports the following templates:
   name: recursive
   required: false
   type: boolean
+- arrayElemType: string
+  description: IgnoredKeys is a list of keys whose values are not checked for sorting,
+    at any nesting level, for example "labels" and "annotations". The order of the
+    ignored key itself among its siblings is still checked.
+  name: ignoredKeys
+  negationAllowed: false
+  regexAllowed: false
+  required: false
+  type: array
 ```
 
 ## Startup Port Exposed
diff --git a/pkg/templates/sortedkeys/internal/params/gen-params.go b/pkg/templates/sortedkeys/internal/params/gen-params.go
index 47e838d..8bfdc19 100644
--- a/pkg/templates/sortedkeys/internal/params/gen-params.go
+++ b/pkg/templates/sortedkeys/internal/params/gen-params.go
@@ -30,10 +30,27 @@ var (
